      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Bastion-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, yes, young friend, don't be fooled by the rigid order of the Mantises. They're ruthless and conniving too.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Vendor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RomoNightEyes_KHR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1249031,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Bastion-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They're constantly scheming and breaking rules when they think no one is watching. But I watch, even if I am blind. Ooh, yes, yes.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Vendor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RomoNightEyes_KHR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1249031,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Bastion-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Why the rotten thief, Zandra the QuietOne, has been stealing things right from under everyone's noses.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Vendor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RomoNightEyes_KHR_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1249031,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Bastion-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And who gets blamed when things go missing? Yes, yes, Romo, that's who! But no one believes me when I tell them it is Zandra.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Vendor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RomoNightEyes_KHR_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1249031,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Bastion-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Maybe you can expose Zandra's thievery, yes? She hordes her pilfered prizes in a burrow in the Silent Market. Oh yes, Good luck!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Vendor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/RomoNightEyes_KHR_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1249031,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
